DESCRIPTION;ALTREP="https://www.dnalounge.com/calendar/2026/06-27a.html":
 Flavor Group presents\n
 KUMTA FAMILY EXPERIENCE\n\n
 Main Room:\n\n
   Shortkut\n
   Coflo\n
   Winter Jendayi\n
   Elephant Graveyard\n
   KUMTA FAMILY BAND\n
   ...plus special guests!\n\n
 A gathering of worlds variety show featuring live music\, DJs\, street
  dancers\, Afro Brazilian Capoeira\, indigenous medicine music\,
  spoken word\, circus and more surprises.\n\n
 All of these elements converge in a celebration that is part concert\,
  part ceremony\, and all spectacle -- and all anchored by our family
  band.\n\n
 Watch and listen:\n
   Winter Jendayi: Toda Mi Vida: https://youtu.be/tIWCn_IHEYs\n\n
 hiphop. soul. metal. capoeira. indigenous medicine music.\n
 4pm - 9pm.\n
 all ages.\n
 FREE ADMISSION!
